title: "ESPIRA: Feasibility of Electrostatic Debris Removal in Low Earth Orbit"
abstract: "A concept study for an electrostatic debris-removal spacecraft, a first-order physics assessment showing the concept is not viable in low Earth orbit, and a real-time mission visualisation."
